{
  "file_id": "3542",
  "text_count": 266,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������So, where do we go from here?",
      "_offset": 1254,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Gennai told us to go to Server\nContinent, but...",
      "_offset": 1292,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "According to the map I just\nreceived, Server Continent is\nquite a distance from here.",
      "_offset": 1341,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Do we *have* to go? I mean,\nDevimon's gone...",
      "_offset": 1427,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "We know this island pretty well,\nand we won't have problems finding\nfood and water.",
      "_offset": 1473,
      "_length": 83,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "What do you mean by that?",
      "_offset": 1557,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "I mean, can we trust this Gennai\nguy and what he said about Server\nContinent?",
      "_offset": 1583,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Can we believe he's on our side\njust because he sent us a map?",
      "_offset": 1661,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "But if we just hang around here,\nwe'll never return home!",
      "_offset": 1724,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "We had so much trouble with\nDevimon, and there are even more\ndangerous enemies ahead...",
      "_offset": 1782,
      "_length": 87,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "We don't even have a way to get to\na continent across the ocean.",
      "_offset": 1870,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "And there are probably even more\nweird Digimon.",
      "_offset": 1935,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "We should probably check this\nplace out a bit more.",
      "_offset": 1983,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "What's with you guys?",
      "_offset": 2035,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "...Let's go.",
      "_offset": 2061,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "T.K?!",
      "_offset": 2074,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Even if we don't know what kind of\nenemies will be waiting for us, we\nshould go!",
      "_offset": 2083,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "I think Angemon would agree, so,\nI...",
      "_offset": 2164,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "We'll go! At the very least, if we\ncan find those Tags and Crests...",
      "_offset": 2202,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "I'm sure I can evolve more and\nprotect you, Tai!",
      "_offset": 2271,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Agumon...",
      "_offset": 2323,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Let's go, Sora!",
      "_offset": 2333,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "We'll pull through, okay?",
      "_offset": 2349,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "I'll be the most beautiful flower\non Server Continent!",
      "_offset": 2375,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "I'll cross the whole ocean if I\nhave to!",
      "_offset": 2430,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Matt, let's go!",
      "_offset": 2471,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "...okay!",
      "_offset": 2489,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Let's go!",
      "_offset": 2498,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Okay, I'll go too!",
      "_offset": 2508,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "If everyone else is going, I'll\ntag along!",
      "_offset": 2527,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "A new continent, huh?",
      "_offset": 2570,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Okay, it's decided! We're going to\nServer Continent!",
      "_offset": 2592,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 2645,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Now that it looks like you're done\ntalking...",
      "_offset": 2651,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Leomon!",
      "_offset": 2697,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "We heard rumors that you're going\nto Server Continent, and these\nguys wanted to help you out.",
      "_offset": 2705,
      "_length": 93,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Hey!",
      "_offset": 2799,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "You need a ship, right? We'll help\nout!",
      "_offset": 2804,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "We want to help you guys, too.",
      "_offset": 2844,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Thanks, guys!",
      "_offset": 2875,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "How do we get to the other side?",
      "_offset": 2889,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "You can cross if you can find\nsomething to use as a bridge.",
      "_offset": 2922,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "To use as a bridge...?",
      "_offset": 2982,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Yes, like a bunch of logs or\nsomething.",
      "_offset": 3005,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Logs...okay, let's go find some!",
      "_offset": 3045,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Be careful around here. The trees\nare falling in this direction.",
      "_offset": 3078,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Are you cutting down trees to make\na raft?",
      "_offset": 3143,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "These are some nice logs! Hey,\nLeomon! Can we use them?",
      "_offset": 3186,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Take as many as you like!",
      "_offset": 3242,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Hey, Centarumon, we found some\nlogs!",
      "_offset": 3268,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Ah, perfect. They'll make a good\nbridge.",
      "_offset": 3305,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "There, now you can cross.",
      "_offset": 3346,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Thanks, Centarumon!",
      "_offset": 3372,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "What are you doing, Elecmon?",
      "_offset": 3392,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Oh, I'm trying to fish for food,\nbut I don't have any bait.",
      "_offset": 3421,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "In that case, we'll help you out\nand find some bait!",
      "_offset": 3481,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Thanks!",
      "_offset": 3534,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Heeeey, Mojyamon!",
      "_offset": 3542,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "I've found some nice food!",
      "_offset": 3560,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Really? What'd you find?",
      "_offset": 3587,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Look, some nice earthworms!",
      "_offset": 3612,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Kyaaaaaah! They're squirming\naround...",
      "_offset": 3640,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Mojyamon, humans can't eat\nearthworms.",
      "_offset": 3679,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "You should've told me sooner!",
      "_offset": 3718,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "But we can use it for fish bait!\nIf that's okay with you.",
      "_offset": 3748,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Yeah! Take it!",
      "_offset": 3806,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Thanks! This'll be a great help!",
      "_offset": 3821,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Elecmon! We got some bait!",
      "_offset": 3854,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "The fish'll be biting like crazy\nwith this. One sec...see, look!",
      "_offset": 3881,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Ah! A DigiCarp!",
      "_offset": 3946,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Heheh, I'm not bad at this!",
      "_offset": 3962,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Thank you!",
      "_offset": 3990,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "It's mine!",
      "_offset": 4001,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "I'm the one who found it!",
      "_offset": 4012,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Meramon...and Frigimon? Why are\nyou two fighting?",
      "_offset": 4038,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "It's this DigiPiece! Meramon\ncalled dibs on it, but I'm the one\nwho found it!",
      "_offset": 4091,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "I was the one who climbed the tree\nto retrieve it from the branch!\nAll *you* did was find it!",
      "_offset": 4169,
      "_length": 93,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "But all you did was climb a tree.\nHonestly, you fire-type Digimon\nare so pushy...",
      "_offset": 4263,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "No, Ice-type Digimon are just\ncowards! Give me back my\nDigiPiece!",
      "_offset": 4345,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Stop it! I asked you to explain,\nnot to start fighting again!",
      "_offset": 4411,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Okay, then you decide whose\nDigiPiece it is, Tai!",
      "_offset": 4473,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Hey, that's a good idea!",
      "_offset": 4526,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Huh? Don't just spring that on me\nall of a sudden.",
      "_offset": 4551,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Frigimon found it, so it's his!",
      "_offset": 4602,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Meramon did the work, so it's his!",
      "_offset": 4637,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "See? It's mine!",
      "_offset": 4672,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "If that's what Tai says, I have\nto go along with it.",
      "_offset": 4688,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Hey, don't feel bad! So, about the\nDigiPiece I found...",
      "_offset": 4744,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Here, Tai! You can have it!",
      "_offset": 4800,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Huh? Me?",
      "_offset": 4831,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Yeah! When I found it, I was\nthinking I'd give you it as a\npresent.",
      "_offset": 4840,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Hey, that's what I was planning,\ntoo!",
      "_offset": 4908,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Well, now that we've cleared that\nup... thanks!",
      "_offset": 4946,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "So, here's the...huh?",
      "_offset": 4994,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "What's wrong?",
      "_offset": 5016,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "The DigiPiece changed. Maybe it's\nbecause I was holding it?",
      "_offset": 5030,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Huh, so that can happen?",
      "_offset": 5090,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "See, I knew you'd say that,\nTai!",
      "_offset": 5115,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Hmmm, I'm not convinced...",
      "_offset": 5151,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Hahaha, the people who put in\neffort are the ones who get\nrewarded. Don't feel too bad!",
      "_offset": 5178,
      "_length": 87,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Here, Tai, it's for you!",
      "_offset": 5266,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "Ehh? For me?",
      "_offset": 5294,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "I was thinking I'd give it to you,\nso here, take it!",
      "_offset": 5307,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Huh, that's what I was thinking as\nwell.",
      "_offset": 5360,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Well, now that we've cleared that\nup... thanks!",
      "_offset": 5401,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "So, here's the...huh?",
      "_offset": 5449,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "What's wrong?",
      "_offset": 5471,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "The DigiPiece changed. Maybe it's\nbecause I was holding it?",
      "_offset": 5485,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "Huh, so that can happen?",
      "_offset": 5545,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "Tai!",
      "_offset": 5570,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "Hm? What's up, Yokomon?",
      "_offset": 5578,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "A present for you, Tai! I found\nthis in the forest, so I thought\nI'd give it to you!",
      "_offset": 5603,
      "_length": 87,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Thanks, Yokomon!",
      "_offset": 5691,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "You're welcome!",
      "_offset": 5709,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "Hm? I smell fish...",
      "_offset": 5725,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "Oh! Elecmon gave this to us. See,\nit's a DigiCarp! Are you hungry?",
      "_offset": 5745,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "english": "No, thank you...I don't really\nlike fish.",
      "_offset": 5812,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "english": "Huh, that's a surprise.",
      "_offset": 5854,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "english": "That's not good! Mommy always told\nme that you can't get strong if\nyou don't eat fish!",
      "_offset": 5878,
      "_length": 86,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "english": "Well...you're probably right,\nbut...",
      "_offset": 5965,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "english": "You say something to Leomon too,\nTai!",
      "_offset": 6002,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "english": "Leomon, you shouldn't be picky.",
      "_offset": 6043,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "english": "You should listen to Leomon.",
      "_offset": 6075,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "english": "No, it's not that. I got food\npoisoning from a fish once and \nseeing one makes my whiskers itch.",
      "_offset": 6104,
      "_length": 96,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "english": "Oh! So you're not being picky?",
      "_offset": 6201,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "english": "Sorry, Leomon!",
      "_offset": 6232,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "english": "Sorry about that, Leomon.",
      "_offset": 6247,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "english": "Don't worry about it! It's just\nthat my whiskers get on edge even\nat the mention of fish.",
      "_offset": 6273,
      "_length": 89,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "english": "Okay, but why?",
      "_offset": 6363,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "english": "Actually, I got food poisoning\nfrom a fish a while back and even\nseeing one makes my whiskers itch.",
      "_offset": 6378,
      "_length": 99,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "english": "Ah, so that's it...",
      "_offset": 6478,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "english": "Can't do anything about that.\nSorry, I shouldn't have tried to\nget you to eat it.",
      "_offset": 6498,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "english": "No big deal, don't worry about it.",
      "_offset": 6580,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "english": "We've got logs to make a raft...",
      "_offset": 6615,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "english": "And some fish to eat while we're\non the ocean, but...",
      "_offset": 6648,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "english": "We can't find a large cloth to\nmake a sail...",
      "_offset": 6702,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "english": "That's no good.",
      "_offset": 6748,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "english": "Let's head back to where we\nstarted, then. We'll come up with\na new plan.",
      "_offset": 6764,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "english": "Yeah. There aren't any dangerous\nDigimon around here, anyway.",
      "_offset": 6838,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "english": "Hey, everyone!",
      "_offset": 6900,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "english": "Monzaemon! What's up?",
      "_offset": 6915,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "english": "I thought you'd need a cloth to\nmake a sail, so I picked one up at\nToy Town!",
      "_offset": 6937,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "english": "Really?!",
      "_offset": 7014,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "english": "Yeah! Though to be honest, it's\nactually my bedsheet...",
      "_offset": 7023,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "english": "As long as it's big enough for a\nsail, it's fine!",
      "_offset": 7079,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "english": "Really? I'm glad!",
      "_offset": 7129,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "english": "We can finish the raft now!",
      "_offset": 7147,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "english": "I'll carry the raft for you.",
      "_offset": 7175,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "english": "Are you ready to leave?",
      "_offset": 7204,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "english": "Yeah! Let's go to Server Continent!",
      "_offset": 7228,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "english": "We're not ready yet. Wait a little!",
      "_offset": 7264,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "english": "All right, we'll wait for you at\nthe beach!",
      "_offset": 7300,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "english": "Call us when you're ready.",
      "_offset": 7344,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "english": "I wonder if this'll hold up out\nthere...",
      "_offset": 7371,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "english": "I'm sure if anyone can get across\nthis ocean, it'll be you guys.",
      "_offset": 7412,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "english": "Thanks, Leomon! It's all thanks to\nall your help.",
      "_offset": 7477,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "english": "Ah!",
      "_offset": 7527,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "english": "What's wrong?!",
      "_offset": 7531,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "english": "The DigiEgg, it hatched!",
      "_offset": 7546,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "english": "How cute!",
      "_offset": 7571,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "english": "Yaaaaay!",
      "_offset": 7581,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "english": "Thank you so much!",
      "_offset": 7590,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "english": "Goodbye!",
      "_offset": 7609,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "english": "Farewell, Chosen Children!",
      "_offset": 7618,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "english": "Ugh, I don't feel good...",
      "_offset": 7645,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "english": "I didn't think it would shake this\nmuch.",
      "_offset": 7671,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "english": "How much longer are we gonna be on\nhere?",
      "_offset": 7712,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "english": "We've just started!",
      "_offset": 7753,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "english": "But we only have so much food and\nwater. There's only enough for\nabout half a month.",
      "_offset": 7773,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "english": "Joe...",
      "_offset": 7858,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "english": "You've gotta pull yourself together!",
      "_offset": 7865,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "english": "If we run out, we can catch fish.",
      "_offset": 7902,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "english": "I'm just worried because I'm your\nsenior! If we run out of food,\nwe're done for!",
      "_offset": 7936,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "english": "Well, you're right, but...",
      "_offset": 8017,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "english": "You're right! And there'll\nprobably be rain before we run out\nof water!",
      "_offset": 8044,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "english": "Yeah! If we put our minds to it,\nthings will work out somehow.",
      "_offset": 8116,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "english": "Thanks, Tai! I feel a bit\nbetter now!",
      "_offset": 8179,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "english": "W-what's going on?",
      "_offset": 8220,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "english": "Kyaaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 8239,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "english": "Something's approaching us from\nbehind!",
      "_offset": 8254,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "english": "An island!",
      "_offset": 8294,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "english": "No, that's not an island!",
      "_offset": 8305,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "english": "It's Whamon! He usually stays at\nthe bottom of the ocean, so why is\nhe here?",
      "_offset": 8331,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "english": "He's coming this way!",
      "_offset": 8408,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "english": "We're gonna get swallowed!",
      "_offset": 8430,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "english": "We're being consumed! And by\n\"consumed\", I don't mean the\neconomic definition!",
      "_offset": 8457,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "english": "We *know*!",
      "_offset": 8536,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "english": "So he really is eating us...",
      "_offset": 8547,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "english": "And we can't do anything but sit\nand watch.",
      "_offset": 8576,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "english": "We're in an open space...",
      "_offset": 8620,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "english": "I think we're out of the\nesophagus. In other words, we're\nin the stomach.",
      "_offset": 8646,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "english": "Isn't that where food is digested?",
      "_offset": 8720,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "english": "If we don't escape from here\nquickly, *we're* the ones who'll\nbe digested!",
      "_offset": 8755,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "english": "Ah! Tai, over there!",
      "_offset": 8830,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "english": "A black gear...",
      "_offset": 8854,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "english": "So that's why Whamon's on a\nrampage!",
      "_offset": 8870,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "english": "I'll give you something to climb\non! Poison Ivy!",
      "_offset": 8907,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "english": "Okay, I'm going!",
      "_offset": 8956,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "english": "There's a pool of gastric juice\nunderneath, this thing's swaying a\nlot ...ah!",
      "_offset": 8973,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "english": "Tai!",
      "_offset": 9051,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "english": "Tai! Step on the left ivy!",
      "_offset": 9059,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "english": "Tai! Step on the right ivy!",
      "_offset": 9089,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "english": "Ah!...There we go!",
      "_offset": 9120,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "english": "Okay! Now grab it with your right\nhand!",
      "_offset": 9139,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "english": "Thanks, Matt! You're a huge\nhelp!",
      "_offset": 9179,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "english": "You're not too bad yourself, with\nthat quick reaction and all.",
      "_offset": 9215,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "english": "Well, I'll leave it to you to\nguide me up there!",
      "_offset": 9278,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "english": "Oof! There we go! Ah?!",
      "_offset": 9327,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "english": "The other way! On *my* right, not\nyour right!",
      "_offset": 9350,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "english": "I can't think that quickly!",
      "_offset": 9396,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "english": "Hey! I'm trying to help you out\nhere!",
      "_offset": 9424,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "english": "Just keep your mouth shut, okay...",
      "_offset": 9462,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "english": "Just a bit more! Keep at it!",
      "_offset": 9497,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "english": "All right, I'm pulling out the\ngear!",
      "_offset": 9526,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "english": "Uwaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 9563,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "english": "Are you okay, Sora?",
      "_offset": 9576,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 9596,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "english": "We made it out, somehow!",
      "_offset": 9602,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "english": "Are you okay, Poyomon?",
      "_offset": 9627,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "english": "I apologize for acting so\nviolently.",
      "_offset": 9650,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "english": "No worries! It's the black gear's\nfault.",
      "_offset": 9687,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "english": "I feel refreshed now, thanks to\nyou.",
      "_offset": 9728,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "english": "Hey, Whamon, how far is it to\nServer Continent from here?",
      "_offset": 9765,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "english": "It would take me five days to get\nthere.",
      "_offset": 9823,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "english": "That's pretty far...",
      "_offset": 9864,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "english": "So then, do you know anything\nabout those Tags that Devimon hid?\nOr the Crests for that matter?",
      "_offset": 9885,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "english": "Tags and Crests...I don't know\nanything.",
      "_offset": 9981,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "english": "Oh...",
      "_offset": 10022,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "english": "But I do know that Devimon went\nunder the sea once and put\nsomething there...",
      "_offset": 10028,
      "_length": 77,
